  "details": "Seemingly at random, the \"Initializing World...\" screen will appear and block all access to the UI/client, making VRChat inaccessible without a restart, or completely unplayable if the effect repeats after multiple logins\n\n- Does not occur on every login\n\n- Occurs shortly after logging in after a random period of time has passed\n\n- Occurs with or without interaction with the open VRC client\n\n- Occurs less frequently since the latest build update\n\n- (Uncertain/Potentially unrelated) Did not begin occurring until I began uploading content via Unity\n\nWill update as and when I can identify any other repeating behaviors",
